│   └── search-grammar.md
├── checklists/
│   └── requirements.md
└── tasks.md                 # Created only after plan approval
```

### Source Code (repository root)

```text
src/
├── client/
│   ├── app/
│   ├── components/
│   ├── features/
│   │   ├── bookmarks/
